# A run that stops pushes its escalation to an escalated/ ref, and the file
# reaches main only when a sweep folds it. The ref alone parks the task from the
# moment it is pushed. The id is matched whole: the ref names M1-01, not M1-0,
# and M1-02 is offered as it was.
run available
exit 0
claims escalated/M1-01-stopped-on-a-wall
file tasks/M1-0.md
	---
	id: M1-0
	depends_on: []
	exclusive: no
	---
file tasks/M1-01.md
	---
	id: M1-01
	depends_on: []
	exclusive: no
	---
file tasks/M1-02.md
	---
	id: M1-02
	depends_on: []
	exclusive: no
	---
stdout
	M1-0
	M1-02
